OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds attend Jacob Elordi
OL,4,Alookalike competition
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people turned out to watch
OL,7,Fa Jacob Elordi lookalike contest which
OL,8,Fsaw youngsters don their finest tote
OL,9,Fbags and slouchy sweatshirts.
OL,11,FThe event, which was organised by
OL,12,FUniversity of Bristol social media
OL,13,Fcommunity Overheard, took place on
OL,14,FCollege Green.
OL,16,FAcclaimed Australian actor Elordi is
OL,17,Fbest known for his roles in The Kissing
OL,18,FBooth, Saltburn, Frankenstein,
OL,19,FWuthering Heights, Priscilla and the
OL,20,FHBO series Euphoria.
