OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds attend Jacob Elordi
OL,4,Alookalike competition
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite some worthy competitors
OL,7,Fperforming their best catwalk struts
OL,8,Fand Australian accents, the title was
OL,9,Fawarded to a 17-year-old girl who did
OL,10,Fnot want to be named.
